380623", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12448899_1155455737837776_10203191_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nL5dF-5ga10Q7kNvwEkEmUl&_nc_oc=AdrXayX5F3PiQazxvva9oTV9kxlzOADATndV_0sF9OzbOYPjxgWxpIKehVm8QbtFho8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0Sk6PSCyAP1SkAS24kh2nKOHiAYwIQIJU2wD4rhh0zQ&oe=6AFC6A11"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "544703409511940", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12522199_131697227244106_814250366_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WhAo32AuhXIQ7kNvwH-Mppi&_nc_oc=AdqSM8XdQ9ha_rc7cpQJIoiEHyOVBh4Ri-GvLY7eFpM3PkJStLZIqYoAD2P6VOndCDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTbem9DfXnbqwh1jPZk5FtFJu9tzXEiI3GbuL0pmGWNaQ&oe=6AFC6148"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "264628114537266", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12680260_240524789656314_1180019102_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ScwC_GcE7k8Q7kNvwFA_78S&_nc_oc=AdpiEpGR1Tar6WMVAYuNwzjc48L6w0unymXMg9G3HVt9zDiJc50DYJRtfD6hygc0MYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTxEBCKwuFw299qY8aM2_T5BzpIYCRDfVnHbT_N-0_F_w&oe=6AFC87F6"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "160862711668837", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12448853_1318777048151234_251025723_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xVC2ZAt7HmQQ7kNvwEZHy-e&_nc_oc=AdpcfIm3pO8L4rfEJ_OKxwbntYoba_VgkWopJD8LP9ezBSVZ_KXTbjFi103JlzQ2AHs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT2EUKJ-ouow2B9qfdI__XvRehEnOA_lMhxvJZyh7pi1w&oe=6AFC83E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dark Days", "keywords": ["Thriller", "Horror", "Adventure", "Escaperoom", "Storydriven"], "long_description": "/!\\ Note: 2GB of your device storage is needed to complete the install process (final size: 668 MB)\n\n\"Dark Days is probably the most visually complete game on the Gear VR\" -MobileVRDaily\n\n\"A Creepy and Surprising Psychological Thriller\" -UploadVR\n\nThe team that created White Night has gathered once again to offer you a hauntingly unique VR experience. Somewhere between Twin Peaks and The X-\u00adFiles, Dark Days is a new fantastic virtual reality adventure. You will have to discover what\u2019s going on with an eerie desert motel and its surroundings by solving a number of puzzles. Immerse yourself in the rich environments you will come across, but be careful and smart! Something is roaming around you... \n\n\u274f A supernatural adventure full of revelations \n\u274f Accessible gameplay and random puzzles \n\u274f Be prepared for jump scares! \n\nTechnical contact : contact@parallel-studio.com", "short_description": "\"Dark Days is probably the most visually complete game on the Gear VR\" -MobileVRDaily Somewhere between Twin Peaks and The X-\u00adFiles, Dark Days is a new fantastic virtual reality adventure. You will have to discover what\u2019s going on with an eerie desert motel and its surroundings by solving a number of puzzles. Immerse yourself in the rich environments you will come across, but be careful and smart! Something is roaming around you..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "publisher_name": "Oculus Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "HORROR", "NARRATIVE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_me